title: "Coping Dynamics Sequencing"
abstract: "Reproducible analysis pipeline for behavioral motif, freezing, and stress-coping dynamics in mice, built on keypoint-MoSeq syllables, litter-clustered statistical models, and a behavior classifier for resilience prediction."
